<title>UK: TABLE-Amvescap boosts H1 profits.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Amvescap boosts H1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		10.4		   vs 8.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.5		    vs 2.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     73.5 ($122.7)	vs 32.0</p>
<p> Income		     220.2 ($367.7)     vs 114.3</p>
<p>Full company name - Amvescap Plc. The company was created from the merger of Invesco Plc and U.S. group AIM Management Group, which was completed on February 28, 1997. The company said funds under management stood at 106.3 billion pounds at June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
